  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annual 4YP Reflections Process 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Annually, via the 4YP Reflection Process, PDG has an opportunity to showcase our achievements through MFAT&#x2019;s corporate report to parliament, and to reflect on our performance and identify learnings and improvements in delivering Aotearoa New&#xa0;Zealand&#x2019;s development and foreign policy goals over the last year. This&#xa0;involves 4YP plan and thematic teams completing reflection reports which are discussed in Governance Group Reflection Meetings, and summarised in a synthesis report presented to PDLT.</narrative>
  </description>
